## 📅 14. Working with Dates

```python
df["Date"] = pd.to_datetime(df["Date"])    # 📆 Convert to datetime format
df["Year"] = df["Date"].dt.year             # 📆 Extract year
df["Month"] = df["Date"].dt.month           # 📆 Extract month
df["Day"] = df["Date"].dt.day               # 📆 Extract day
```

